# Credential scratch files. A `git add -A` once staged "unison client value.txt"
# — the Entra app secret in plaintext — and only GitHub push protection stopped
# it reaching the remote. Secrets belong in .env.local, never in a loose file.
*value.txt
*secret*.txt
*credential*.txt
